.\logs\codex-20261027T2149587696149Z-809a0824850349d192d0d78549a2a815.log:8986:No WU2 exception is implemented: the TESTING prerequisite is checked at issuance, authorization consumption, and the final execution boundaries. Changing that gate would also change a manifest-bound framework file, so the existing approval remains valid evidence for its original bytes but cannot approve the changed framework. I╬ô├ç├ûll report the narrow amendment needed and stop without implementation.
